</rp></ruby>してくれませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你能给我一个霍奇吻吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">微か</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かすか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">微弱；隐约；模糊；朦胧；贫乏；微薄；稀少；寒酸</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"161206\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はかすかに<ruby>微笑<rp>(</rp><rt>ほほえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我真的微笑了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">霞む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かすむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变得朦胧；变得模糊；笼罩上薄雾；变得模糊；变暗淡；变朦胧；被掩盖；被抢风头；黯然失色</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179429\"><ruby>空<rp>(</rp><rt>そら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどんよりとした<ruby>冬<rp>(</rp><rt>ふゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>陰<rp>(</rp><rt>かげ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にかすんでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">天空在寒冷的冬天背后。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">化する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变成；转变为；转化为；影响；产生影响</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">擦る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">擦过；轻触；划伤；提成；抽取佣金；剥削；榨取</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224998\">こうじはついていた。<ruby>交通事故<rp>(</rp><rt>こうつうじこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でたった<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のサイドをちょっとかすっただけだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">此分类上一篇: 在交通事故中,我只是在车的侧面打了一点。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">数</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かず</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">数字；数量；个数</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78140\"><ruby>旅行者<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこうしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>数<rp>(</rp><rt>かず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>近年<rp>(</rp><rt>きんねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きく<ruby>増加<rp>(</rp><rt>ぞうか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">近年来,旅客人数大幅增加。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">火星</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">火星（行星）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186655\"><ruby>火星<rp>(</rp><rt>かせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>生物<rp>(</rp><rt>せいぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>形跡<rp>(</rp><rt>けいせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">火星上没有生物的痕迹。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">化石</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かせき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a cla